### 🌿 Sustainability Performance as a Core Value Proposition

Rather than acting as a post-hoc environmental add-on, sustainability performance is directly monetized through B2G/B2B compliance value propositions:

* **Supporting ESG & Regulatory Compliance (CSRD / CSDDD):** Enables border authorities and European logistics operators to generate automated, audit-ready Scope 3 carbon accounting reports based on verified diesel savings ($2.68\text{ kg CO}_2/\text{Liter}$)[cite: 1].
* **Evidence-Based Policy & Investment Decisions:** Provides public authorities with empirical digital twin simulation data to prove whether multi-million euro capital investments (e.g., dedicated bypass lanes, BESS microgrids) are financially bankable before spending public funds[cite: 1].
* **Resource & Food Waste Prevention:** Prioritizes high-vulnerability cold-chain cargo (food/pharma) through automated fast-lanes, directly preventing perishable cargo spoilage during prolonged border holds[cite: 1].


